  ],
  "summary": "The keyboard matrix is not wired exclusively to GPIO-capable pins: multiple row/column nets share SKW92A pins identified in the netlist as Ethernet PHY signals. This contradicts the specified GPIO matrix interface and is likely to impair keyboard operation."
}

